Subject: [PATCH 47/49] docs: credit the client-side encryption to upstream in
 every README

The encryption was developed upstream by Tiziano Bacocco; the paper key, the
QR code export and the key import are Nimbus Backup additions. Said in the
encryption section of the 13 READMEs (11 in AI translation).
